== Trivia ==

* It is not possible to obtain glass on this map because the player is restricted to a [[blast furnace]], which cannot smelt the [[red sand]] on Nostromo, and [[Furnace|regular furnaces]] cannot be crafted because no stone is available.
* On Nostromo and Outpost 31, the [[yellow concrete]] bordering the building area can be broken, yet the block's name is still "Yellow Concrete".
* There are also [[coal]] deposits on Nostromo, allowing for backup if the coal blocks that come with the blast furnace is lost.
* Nostromo is technically inside [[the Nether]].
* The map name could be a reference to the [[w:TRAPPIST-1|TRAPPIST-1]] star system, famous for being a primary candidate to harbor habitable worlds outside of Earth's solar system.
